{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34253","headline":"奉和袭美茶具十咏 茶笋 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美茶具十咏 茶笋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"所孕和气深，时抽玉苕短。\n轻烟渐结华，嫩蘂初成管。\n寻来青霭曙，欲去红云煖。\n秀色自难逢，倾筐不曾满。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34253.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34253","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}